(7404517, 1165913, 50189, '<td valign="top">Skye is a beautiful collie.  He looks in the face a lot like my "Mac", but Mac has a lot of Mahogany color in his fur.  I love to watch him run and all the fur flowing in the wind.  I always think everyone should have a collie, such wonderful animals, with great personalities. He hardly ever leaves my side, going where ever I go. Hope to see more of Skye.</td>', 'Skye is a beautiful collie.  He looks in the face a lot like my "Mac", but Mac has a lot of Mahogany color in his fur.  I love to watch him run and all the fur flowing in the wind.  I always think everyone should have a collie, such wonderful animals, with great personalities. He hardly ever leaves my side, going where ever I go. Hope to see more of Skye.', '2015-09-14 17:43:35.000000', NULL, 0),
